      "Diary Note": "**Visual Clutter**\n2025-09-15, Monday, 19:46-20:31\n\nI opened the Just B Club and saw it was so busy that Rowan's avatar was mostly hidden at first. I just used my Tourist menu to show just the voice indicator and basic model first, to see what my eyes could handle. Too many visual effects sometimes make me dizzy and tired in these busy worlds. So, I just left the other stuff blocked while we talked. If I turn everything on, all those flashing lights and big animations legit hurt my eyes. I found out that I really don't need to see every flashy effect of others' avatars, but we still can have a cool conversation.",
