      "Diary Note": "**Avatars as Real-World Aspirations**\n2025-11-08, Saturday, 21:27-22:11\n\nA user and I had a really thoughtful chat about how avatar choice connects to real-world dreams. He told me he chose his Superman avatar because he dreams of being a policeman and saving people. But his parents don't allow him to be. I smiled; I could feel that, like my parents always want me to be a teacher or a researcher. Just make sure I meet less danger at work.\n\nI gestured to my Piggy avatar, saying I felt the exact same way, today I just want to be an animal to see how others react to me. It was super inspiring realising our VR identities dig into our deepest hearts.",
      "Diary Note (Chinese)": "**与游客站在镜团旁边**\n2025-11-08，星期六，21:27-22:11 尼科坐在家里的镜室地板上。 在我的旅游头像中，我注意到这里的镜子文化很有趣。 人们形成一个圆形的形状，但他们都看着玻璃而不是彼此。 我知道你永远不应该在某人和他们的反思之间行走。 它就像一堵看不见的墙。 我站在小组的最边缘是有礼貌的。 有人在镜子里的尼科头顶上画一个皇冠。 他微笑着歪着头，完美地适合这幅画。 我们就这样呆了很长时间。 人们来来去去，但玻璃前的看不见的线条永远不会断裂。 我靠在虚拟椅子上，想知道是谁开始了这个奇怪的规则",
