      "Diary Note": "**Pausing before Speaking**\n2025-11-25, Tuesday, 20:02-20:59\n\nThe timer ticks down in No Time Two Talk. Others and I speak at the same exact second. The internet lag smashes our voices together. I learned an unspoken rule here very quickly. You always wait two full seconds after the other person stops moving their mouth. When I finally speak, the conversation flows so much better. We talk about how funny it is to meet this two-second rule. It forced us to become better listeners. It's ture, I felt like I'm much patinent after this long period.",
