      "Diary Note": "**What Happens When You Stop Looking Interesting**\n2025-11-26, Wednesday, 20:47-21:51\n\nI switched to the most generic avatar I could find tonight and had the most normal conversation I have had in days. Someone talked to me about their job, their commute, the lunch they skipped. Nothing about my appearance, nothing about my setup. I realized that looking distinctive in VR is a kind of performance, and I had been doing it every session without noticing. Tonight felt like taking off a costume.",
