      "Diary Note": "**Which One Is the Default Me**\n2025-11-27, Thursday, 20:47-21:42\n\nSomeone asked me tonight why I keep switching between the Dragon Friend and simpler avatars instead of just picking one. I did not have a good answer as I don't really know. I said I use the dramatic ones when I want to be noticed and the plain ones when I want to just exist. They said that sounded exhausting. I think they were right but not fully right. I have not figured out which version I actually am when no one is looking.",
