      "Diary Note": "**W Speech**\n2025-12-01, Monday, 19:41-20:52\n\nSomeone out of nowhere asked me tonight why I picked such a funny Richard Moore avatar. Honestly, I didn't overthink it at the time—I just thought it looked kind of silly and lighthearted, and Richard Moore is just inherently funny.\n\nBut then they said something that stuck with me. They mentioned how in real life, they always pay attention to what people wear on a Monday versus a Friday, because Mondays are usually drained and exhausted, while Fridays have that sweet, end-of-the-week relief.\n\nIt made me freeze for a second and reflect. I had just come off a pretty exhausting stretch of work, and maybe picking this goofy avatar wasn't as random as I thought. Even in a virtual space where we can literally be anything, perhaps our subconscious still leaks into the digital skins we choose to wear.",
