      "Diary Note": "**why non-human**\n2025-12-07, Sunday, 20:54-21:48 Someone asked me why I prefer non-human avatars tonight, I said it was because I didn't have to manage my face. They laugh and say, because when you have an animal head, no one expects micro-expression or social cues that you may not feel. Maybe the establishment of a relationship may not require too many social cues in itself? For example, online dating, or people who stay in the Discord server and hang up, can also cultivate a special intimate relationship; in VR, looking at each other's incarnation, I think it is also possible to cultivate a kind of intimate relationship in VR",
      "Diary Note (Chinese)": "**为什么非人**\n2025-12-07，星期日，20:54-21:48 今晚有人问我为什么我更喜欢非人类化身，我说这是因为我不必管理自己的脸。 他们笑着说，因为当你有一个动物头时，没有人会期待你可能没有感受到的微表达或社交线索。或许一段关系的建立可能本身就不需要太多社交线索？比如网恋，或者人们呆在discord服务器里挂机，也能培养一种特殊的亲密关系；VR里看着彼此的化身，我想也有可能会培养一种VR中的亲密关系",
