      "Diary Note": "**What Home Means**\n2025-12-08, Monday, 19:40-20:35\n\nSomeone asked if I missed home tonight, and I did not know how to answer. I said the word home feels strange lately because the place I grew up is not where my life is happening. The house is gone. The whole society changed a lot.\n\nThey said home for them is a smell, not a location. W Speech. Mine might be a time of day, early morning light in a specific kitchen with my grandmother. She lay in the hospital for 4 years. I just miss her, a healthy her.",
      "Diary Note (Chinese)": "**现在家的意思**\n2025-12-08，星期一，19:40-20:35 有人问我今晚是否错过了家，我不知道如何回答。 我说家里最近感觉很奇怪，因为我长大的地方不是我的生活发生的地方。 他们说家对他们来说是一种气味，而不是一个地方。 我想过那个。 我的可能是一天中的某个时间，特定厨房的清晨光线。 我不再有那个厨房了。 我不确定这是否算作想念家或只是错过了一个不再存在的自己生活的版本。",
