      "Diary Note": "**Talk with Strangers**\n2025-12-10, Wednesday, 20:17-21:10\n\nI said something honest to a complete stranger tonight that I've never said to anyone I actually know. I said that I don't actually study as hard as people think—it felt almost like a confession!\n\nI don't know why it was so much easier. Maybe because there was no history between us, no expectation of who I should be. In VR, you can be whoever you want, but the most freeing thing is just being who you really are to someone who knows nothing about you.",
