      "Diary Note": "**Select unreadable**\n2025-12-14, Sunday, 20:19-21:13 I chose Rune tonight, and my face was covered by a rune. I want to test if anyone will mention my avatar, but no one actually mentioned it. The people I talk to were warm and open, and I felt sorry for not matching this energy, but I am an introverted person, and I can't pretend that I am not. Even if I change all kinds of avatars, I feel that I am always an introverted boy trying on different clothes.",
