      "Diary Note": "**Who You Pretend to Be**\n2026-01-10, Saturday, 21:09-21:53\n\nSomeone asked tonight whether people are more honest in VR or less. They said more, because the stakes feel lower. I said less, because the gap between who you present as and who you are gets wider and easier to maintain. Neither of us changed our mind.",
