      "Diary Note": "**Is it harassment?**\n2026-01-12, Monday, 19:53-20:56 \n\nI had a kid rush over to me shouting out of nowhere today. I'm starting to realise that this is just how children express themselves in VR. Though honestly, you see impolite kids like this in real life too. The difference is that in VRChat, they lack the immediate discipline of adults around them, so they become even more unfiltered and reckless.",
      "Diary Note (Chinese)": "**还算是骚扰吗**\n2026-01-12, 星期一, 19:53-20:56 我似乎已经习惯有孩子冲过来大叫这种行为了，我现在把它理解成Social VR里孩子们表达自己的方式，就算放在现实生活中，好像也会有那种不礼貌的小孩，感觉在VRCHAT里他们缺少了大人的管教变得更加肆无忌惮了",
