      "Diary Note": "**Virtual Friendship**\n2026-01-18, Sunday, 20:15-21:11\n\nSomeone asked tonight whether it was actually possible to form a friendship with a person whose face you've never seen, and whose voice you only know through audio compression. I said no, and they seemed pretty surprised. \n\nUsually, once I form a truly close connection with someone in the virtual world (not only in VR but could be social media) , I end up inviting them to meet up offline. It feels like a form of identity verification for me, to see if we still get along just as well after finally seeing each other face-to-face.",
