      "Conversations 5+ min": 3,
      "Harassment/Toxicity": "None",
      "Diary Note": "**Who Are You in Here**\n2026-01-31, Saturday, 21:32-22:28\n\nI asked someone a question and I remembered I asked another a few months ago: do you think the identity you have in VR is a version of your real self, or something separate?\n\nSome of them said separate. Like a character they play who shares some traits but is not the same person.\n\nI said I used to think that too. But the longer I've been in VR the less I believe the separation is real. The same anxieties show up. The same conversational habits. The same things I avoid saying. If it were actually a different identity, those patterns wouldn't follow me in.\n\nIt's kind of going deep!",
