      "Diary Note": "**The Version That Stayed**\n2026-02-02, Monday, 20:31-21:28\n\nAgain, I've been thinking about whether spending this much time in VR has changed anything about who I am offline. The actual interior stuff.\n\nI mentioned it to someone tonight.\n\n\"Like what?\" they asked.\n\n\"Tolerance for uncertainty. In VR you talk to people you know almost nothing about, and you get used to that being fine. Offline I used to wait until I felt like I understood someone before I said anything real to them.\"\n\n\"And now?\"\n\n\"I do that less now.\" They were quiet for a second. \"That might actually be the most useful thing VR has done for you.\"",
