      "Diary Note": "**What We're Actually Doing Here**\n2026-02-04, Wednesday, 20:17-21:12\n\nSomeone asked me tonight what I thought the point of social VR was. \n\nI said I think most people come here looking for a version of social connection that their offline life isn't giving them enough of, like a new form of social media.  This scratches a different part of the same need. More anonymous and more chosen with avatars. More body control as well. Maybe people could feel another form of their identity? They agreed.",
