      "Diary Note": "**Loneliness with an off switch**\n2026-02-05, Thursday, 20:24-21:17\n\nSomeone asked if I ever feel lonely in VR.\n\nI said yes, sometimes. But it's a different quality from offline loneliness. In here I know it can end whenever I choose. That changes what it feels like. Or I can just go to another crowded world.",
