      "Diary Note": "**New Version**\n2026-02-06, Friday, 21:24-22:23\n\nTonight, I spoke out loud about something I'd been mulling over for a while. I pointed out that when we talk about our real lives in VR, we always present a slightly polished version. It’s just an upgraded edit of who we are. Showing confidence and control of our lives.\n\n\nI thought about it. \"Maybe there isn't one. It's just that I used to believe I was being my most genuine self in here. But now I realise I'm just playing to the environment. Like optimising myself to look confident, because confidence is what gets people interested in VR. That’s very different from actually being authentic.\"",
