      "Diary Note": "**Avatar Management**\n2026-02-09, Monday, 20:31-21:26\n\nI spent ten minutes reorganising my favourite avatar menu before even joining a world tonight.\n\nMy friend asked what took me so long.\n\n\"Just cleaning up my avatar list,\" I said.\n\n\"You're not organising files,\" they laughed. \"You're deciding which versions of yourself you want on quick-dial, so you don't need to clean the list!\"\n\nBut I don't really like if there are so many avatars in my avatar library, it's hard for me to find the one I like.",
