      "Diary Note": "**The Idealised Self**\n2026-02-10, Tuesday, 20:07-21:03\n\nI asked someone tonight if they'd ever want an exact 1:1 scan of their real physical body as a VR avatar. Haha. \"Never,\" they said instantly.\n\nI asked them: \"Why not? People always say they want authenticity and a true friend.\"\n\nThey said: \"Authenticity isn't replication,\" they replied. \"We don't come here to copy real life. We come here to express how we want to feel, not just how we happen to look.\"\n\nI thought about my own avatar choices over the months. That distinction made sense.",
