      "Diary Note": "**Mirror Dwellers**\n2026-03-25, Wednesday, 20:22-21:25\n\nI had spent over half a year in this world. When I first joined VRChat, I never quite understood those \"Mirror Dwellers\": people who would stand motionless for hours, staring fixedly at the mirror. Yet, at some point, I couldn't even say when I found myself becoming one of them.\n\nTonight, after switching avatars, I reached out to activate the local mirror and settled down in front of it, as had become my habit. I felt a sudden, inexplicable sense of calm when watching my avatar sway gently in time with my breathing.",
