      "Diary Note": "**The Tranquility of VR Sleep**\nMarch 29, 2026, Sunday, 20:42-21:34\n\nLate this evening, a small cluster of users gathered before a virtual mirror. Several individuals among them were clearly engaged in VR sleep, their headsets still on, and the sound of their breathing was distinctly audible through their open microphones.\n\nI experienced the unique phenomenon of the VR sleep subculture, characterized by individuals, often strangers from across the globe, sharing a communal digital space. In this context, our physical bodies remained at rest, blurring the typical embodied boundaries between our offline and online presences.",
      "Diary Note (Chinese)": "**VR睡眠的静谧**\n2026年3月29日，星期日，20:42-21:34\n\n今晚很晚的时候，一小群用户站在镜子前，其中一些人戴着头显已经熟睡，他们的呼吸声透过麦克风传来。我感受到了VR睡眠亚文化与世界各地的陌生人共享一个数字空间，我们的现实身体则在休息。",
