      "Diary Note": "**Bridge of Culture**\nThursday, April 2, 2026, 20:42-21:34\n\nThis evening, I donned a Chinese-style Hanfu-inspired avatar in the Avatar Testing Chamber.\n\nAs I was examining the details in the mirror, a foreign player approached me, observing me with curiosity, and inquired if I had truly visited ancient Chinese towns in real life, and if people actually wore such garments there. I smiled and recounted to him the ancient villages in my hometown, and also spoke of real-life Chinese ancient towns and cities, such as Xi'an.\n\nWithin VRChat, avatars are sometimes imbued with new symbolic meanings, becoming a conduit for introducing one's culture to international strangers.",
      "Diary Note (Chinese)": "**文化之桥**\n2026年4月2日，星期四，20:42-21:34\n\n今晚在 Avatar Testing Chamber 试穿了一套国风汉服风格的化身。\n\n正当我对着镜子查看细节时，旁边一位外国玩家走过来，好奇地打量着我，问我现实中是否真的去过中国古镇，现实里大家会不会穿这样的衣服。我笑着向他讲起了我的家乡的古村落，还有讲起现实中那些中国的古镇和城市，比如西安。\n\n在 VRChat 里，化身有时候被赋予了新符号，成了向异国陌生人介绍自己文化的窗口。",
