      "Diary Note": "**The Creeping Commodification of Sanctuary**\n2026-07-15, Wednesday, 19:59-21:03\n\nExploring Prismic's Avatar Search in Sylias Space Bunny, I noticed more Patreon links, brand logos, and paid asset advertisements embedded in the world geometry than before. It made me slightly uneasy. The platform I view as a personal sanctuary is slowly being commercialized. It prompted a deep reflection on whether any digital space can remain truly communal once capitalistic incentives take root.",
      "Diary Note (Chinese)": "**研究凝视需要许可**\n2026-07-15，星期三，19:59-21:03\n\n西奥（Theo）正站在速画板（Quick Draw board）前摆姿势。我举起相机，但就在那一刻，我的手柄电池耗尽了。我的“游侠”（Ranger）化身手臂维持着举着隐形相机的动作，卡在一个怪异而扭曲的角度。我无法将其放下。西奥就这样注视着定格在这个尴尬“狗仔姿势”中的我。我试图挥动现实中的手，但虚拟手臂依然完全僵硬……",
